# ── this repo holds MoneyTrack's SOURCE, on the `source` branch ──
# `main` is the published GitHub Pages site, written only by ./deploy.sh (which
# does `git rm -rq .` before copying out/ in — which is why source must never
# live there). The deploy clone below is that checkout; it is not part of the
# source tree.
/.deploy/

# Real bank data and Enable Banking credentials. Transaction exports and the
# application id are personal and belong nowhere near a remote.
/bank-sync/

# Superseded by the V11 redesign; kept on disk, not in history. (legacy-buildless/
# IS tracked — CLAUDE.md calls it the deliberate rollback path.)
/pre-redesign-backup/

# The SwiftUI iOS port has its own repo at ~/Documents/MoneyTracker-iOS.
/MoneyTracker/

# Thesis research that happens to sit in this folder; a different project entirely.
/Fog_LiDAR_*.md
/Introduction_Storyline.md
/.fog_research_harvest.json
